Trappes mayor condemns deadly shooting as 'racist, possibly Islamophobic'

The mayor of Trappes, a city west of Paris, has condemned a deadly shooting as a “racist, probably Islamophobic” attack that left one person dead and four others wounded, including a 12-year-old girl.

@PressTV

At least three killed in Saudi airstrikes on Yemen’s capital

Saudi fighter jets have carried out new airstrikes on several areas across Yemen, including residential buildings in the capital, Sana’a, killing at least three people and injuring several others from the same family.

@PressTV

دو متهم به طراحی حمله تروریستی به موزه یهودیان و یک کنیسه در منچستر، در دادگاه اولد بیلی لندن حاضر شدند. به گفته دادستان‌ها، این دو نفر با فردی در ایران در ارتباط بودند و از او دستور می‌گرفتند.

